Section: misc
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: amancini
Homepage: https://github.com/amancini/webos-alexa-fauxmo
Description: Control an LG webOS TV with Amazon Alexa via an emulated Philips Hue bridge.
 Exposes power, volume, app launch (Netflix/Disney+/Prime/YouTube) and channel
 as Alexa-discoverable devices. Runs an on-TV node service, autostarted on boot.
